- In my testing I noticed the agent keeps hallucinating the tool "get_city_info(city_id='city_world_42_20260501_011925_0001')". Minimize this with stronger prompting (e.g. clearer react trail, comprehensive system prompt) and better tool descriptions and success / failure feedback. Also validate if wrong tool examples have been provided, since the agent keeps hallucinating the same get_city_info() tool.

- In general, the baseline agent performs very poorly on reasoning and gets stuck in one action. Here are some complete agent logs. Infer the challenges that the agent is facing and identify actual causes from the code, then fix. If it is not a code issue or design problem, but rather a fundamental limitation of un-tuned, off-the-shelf LLMs, then state it.
